 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "costs[i][j] is the cost of option j for factory i (rows may have different lengths, each at least 1). Every factory picks exactly one option; the total cost is the sum of the picked costs. Level 3: edges is a list of [u, v] pairs that join the n = costs.length factories into one tree (n-1 edges); joined factories may not pick the same option index. Return the minimum total cost, or -1 when no valid assignment exists.",
